Package: MSARM
Title: Markov-Switching Autoregressive Models
Version: 1.0.1
Authors@R: person("Julian Herbert", "Müller",
                  email = "julian.mueller5353@gmail.com",
                  role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Fits Gaussian Markov-switching autoregressive models in which
    any subset of the intercept, lag coefficients, and innovation variance
    can vary by regime. Provides smoothed regime probabilities, fitted
    values, forecasts, and residual bootstrap prediction intervals.
    Estimation uses the expectation-maximization algorithm of Hamilton
    (1990) <doi:10.1016/0304-4076(90)90093-9>.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: graphics, grDevices, stats, utils
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
URL: https://github.com/jmuelleo/MSARM
BugReports: https://github.com/jmuelleo/MSARM/issues
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
